# Supabase

Email/password only in this SPA. No Apple, Google, anonymous, or Browse. No `localStorage` scrap store. Prefs (`mybrary.lang`, `mybrary.theme`, `mybrary.palette`) stay on the device.

Vite: `VITE_SUPABASE_URL`, `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`. Empty keys keep the intro; the shelf cannot write. Never `service_role` in the client.

Schema: `public.scraps`, RLS `auth.uid() = user_id`. Media: `scrap-media/{userId}/{scrapId}/`. Migration: [`supabase/migrations/20260820140000_scraps_media_realtime.sql`](supabase/migrations/20260820140000_scraps_media_realtime.sql).

Auth redirect origins: `http://localhost:5173`, `https://mybrary-snuu09.web.app`, `https://mybrary-snuu09.firebaseapp.com`.

`/api/analyze` must reject requests whose `mediaPath` is not `{uid}/...`.
